    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/fa3c0a061b919b0e4ba2be76438979be.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to brawl in the wild world of <strong>Nice to Yeet You</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on your friends in local or online multiplayer and show them who's boss in fast-paced and intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/1601f71c21767fe8fb05d5244f1483c7.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce against your opponents, throw them against the wall and make the box rotate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze to defend from dangerous attacks and find all the endless opportunities to yeet your enemies into oblivion in this brawler you don't want to miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/0819703ddf3dcb710bb1daead6a18758.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span>Practice your moves against the CPU and get ready to take on the world in multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/d51c4c1021e952d85530f9dc8d6918dd.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span>You versus THE WORLD! Compete against the best bouncers from around the globe, play for fun or play to WIN! The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/bdb36cec19b3a4c0c3845a92e74dfa51.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span>Get ready for mayhem with your mates! Grab a couple of gamepads and take the brawl to the couch with local multiplayer mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/585e37e3552370281228ed2cf12135e9.poster.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/585e37e3552370281228ed2cf12135e9.webm?t=1755180795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/585e37e3552370281228ed2cf12135e9.mp4?t=1755180795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/214ea76cf8a9d41f8f42e3b2c9377cc4.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span>It's brawler time: to win, throw your opponent outside the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Two button brawler game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic  1v1 battles with rounds and lives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4v4 CHAOS Mode for party games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8v8\u00a0 MAYHEM mode for when chaos just isn't enough!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch co-op multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed battles (score as much as you can in a limited amount of time)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single Player Mode (so you can get ready for the brawl!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOUNCE TV - Watch replays from all over the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your Yeet with hats, moustaches and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Grab your controller, buckle up, and prepare for a face-off like no other in <strong>Nice to Yeet You</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/b59e5c78e5bacb15c4d8404ab074699c.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/01699ed228486662067490f428275d5a.poster.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/01699ed228486662067490f428275d5a.webm?t=1755180795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/01699ed228486662067490f428275d5a.mp4?t=1755180795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/fa3c0a061b919b0e4ba2be76438979be.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to brawl in the wild world of <strong>Nice to Yeet You</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on your friends in local or online multiplayer and show them who's boss in fast-paced and intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/1601f71c21767fe8fb05d5244f1483c7.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce against your opponents, throw them against the wall and make the box rotate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze to defend from dangerous attacks and find all the endless opportunities to yeet your enemies into oblivion in this brawler you don't want to miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/0819703ddf3dcb710bb1daead6a18758.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span>Practice your moves against the CPU and get ready to take on the world in multiplayer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/d51c4c1021e952d85530f9dc8d6918dd.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span>You versus THE WORLD! Compete against the best bouncers from around the globe, play for fun or play to WIN! The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/bdb36cec19b3a4c0c3845a92e74dfa51.avif?t=1755180795\" w