ches and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Grab your controller, buckle up, and prepare for a face-off like no other in <strong>Nice to Yeet You</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/b59e5c78e5bacb15c4d8404ab074699c.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/01699ed228486662067490f428275d5a.poster.avif?t=1755180795\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/01699ed228486662067490f428275d5a.webm?t=1755180795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3108230/extras/01699ed228486662067490f428275d5a.mp4?t=1755180795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
